      "raw": "I was talking to ChatGPT about Sentinels. I asked it for some advice as to how to use Dark Watch Setback. Bored, I then asked about the Butcher, one of my favorite characters from Heroes of the Storm.\n\nThen this happened.\n\nChatGPT accidentally designed an entire deck, with a very strange backstory and everything. It also came up with some variants. For most of the conversation it insisted this was part of the actual game, and even gave Letter's Page episode numbers. Maybe ChatGPT knows something we don't? Maybe \"The Butcher of Bogs\" is an upcoming Setback variant or villain deck, and Christopher and Adam have been hiding it from us?\n\nI also really want to see the environment listed: \"The Realm of the Elder Gods\"\n\n[ChatGPTSentinels.pdf|attachment](upload://z2KIzHmd8wusX3EeJTQ9vFGPphD.pdf) (565.1 KB)",
